`evaluation_id`

The evaluation fact records:

```json
{
  "evaluation_id": "...",
  "timestamp": "...",

  "player_id": "...",

  "model_execution_manifest_id": "...",

  "game_context": {
    "game_id": "...",
    "round_id": "...",
    "guess_id": "...",
    "game_mode": "sync_rush",
